  "objective_text": "Push all three boxes onto the tan targets at cells 24, 56 and 72; any box may fill any target. Keep hunger and hydration above 0.",
  "controls_text": "Arrows: move / push \u00b7 Space: interact \u00b7 W: wait",
  "description": "Push all three boxes onto the tan targets at cells 24, 56 and 72; any box may fill any target. Keep hunger and hydration above 0. Matches the key/door map on PDF page 24: agent starts at 36; red key 8 \u2192 red door 45; orange key 21 \u2192 orange door 61; blue key 74 \u2192 blue door 9; purple key 80 \u2192 purple door 34. Space collects a key on its cell or opens a matching door from an adjacent cell. Keys are retained; doors stay open. No chain pushes. Trees: 1, 37, 44, 78. Lakes: 6, 20, 49, 75; the top lake is moved two cells right from its PDF position (4 \u2192 6), as requested. Hunger and hydration start at 15 and refill to 15; arrow actions deplete each by one; Space/W hold unless refilling. Use factorized Test. The full Cartesian product of this 9x9 three-box map exceeds the tutorial build limit; compact H does not enumerate it.",
